{"case_concurrency": 1, "case_id": "cmb:10016", "dataset_id": "cmb-common-1024", "dataset_selection_sha256": "a504be8585da9dffe566e475acf6ba6e4593248ccb7802c603c799dab8f92cbf", "dataset_snapshot_sha256": "894c9f52a55b35824353c7047443fb03968fb4ab2d680a436c5ced1f1aa1432d", "model_hash": "e5466c735d57bd3e32d4607a3e372b1862579edfef7864ca514e709a38853e26", "profile_id": "B2", "response": {"answer_text": "A, B, C, D\n\n rationale: 从“法律体系”到“法治体系”的转变，体现了法治建设从静态的法律文本向动态的法治实践过程的转变，强调了法律的实施、监督、保障等多方面内容，以及法治的全面性与系统性。选项A、B、C、D均准确反映了这一转变的内涵。", "citations": [], "input_tokens": 1179, "latency_ms": 45092.485, "memory_mode": "off", "model_variant": "qwen3_8b_base", "output_tokens": 951, "parsed_answer": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "provider_calls": 3, "reasoning_mode": "adaptive_mdt", "retrieval_mode": "off", "safety_flags": [], "system_profile": "B2", "tool_calls": 0, "trace_id": "harness-c47e3abad6bd4bcd987336a683a5f352"}, "run_identity": "6b174204f91eba35b1687e6fec05eab311db1cb11982ee2b3fdded385f7bfef8", "score": {"case_id": "cmb:10016", "category": "考研政治", "correct": true, "metric": "exact_set_accuracy", "parse_success": true}, "source_revision": "935fbc09edf1303d89872b21265ff597f426ac0d", "trace_summary": {"mdt_activated": false, "mdt_complexity": "basic", "retrieval_calls": 0, "retrieved_documents": 0}}
{"case_concurrency": 1, "case_id": "cmb:10019", "dataset_id": "cmb-common-1024", "dataset_selection_sha256": "a504be8585da9dffe566e475acf6ba6e4593248ccb7802c603c799dab8f92cbf", "dataset_snapshot_sha256": "894c9f52a55b35824353c7047443fb03968fb4ab2d680a436c5ced1f1aa1432d", "model_hash": "e5466c735d57bd3e32d4607a3e372b1862579edfef7864ca514e709a38853e26", "profile_id": "B2", "response": {"answer_text": "{\"answer\": \"C. 《中国土地法大纲》\"}  \n{\"rationale\": \"《中国土地法大纲》是1947年中共中央在晋绥边区召开的土地会议上通过的重要文件，标志着解放区在农民土地问题上，开始由削弱封建剥削，向变革封建土地关系、废除封建剥削制度过渡。该文件明确规定了废除封建土地所有制，实行耕者有其田的土地改革政策，是土地改革由初步阶段向彻底阶段转变的标志。\"}  \n{\"option\": \"C\"}", "citations": [], "input_tokens": 1053, "latency_ms": 36478.607, "memory_mode": "off", "model_variant": "qwen3_8b_base", "output_tokens": 766, "parsed_answer": "C", "provider_calls": 3, "reasoning_mode": "adaptive_mdt", "retrieval_mode": "off", "safety_flags": [], "system_profile": "B2", "tool_calls": 0, "trace_id": "harness-82961267c717477293c62979627185e6"}, "run_identity": "6b174204f91eba35b1687e6fec05eab311db1cb11982ee2b3fdded385f7bfef8", "score": {"case_id": "cmb:10019", "category": "考研政治", "correct": false, "metric": "exact_choice_accuracy", "parse_success": true}, "source_revision": "935fbc09edf1303d89872b21265ff597f426ac0d", "trace_summary": {"mdt_activated": false, "mdt_complexity": "basic", "retrieval_calls": 0, "retrieved_documents": 0}}
{"case_concurrency": 1, "case_id": "cmb:1002", "dataset_id": "cmb-common-1024", "dataset_selection_sha256": "a504be8585da9dffe566e475acf6ba6e4593248ccb7802c603c799dab8f92cbf", "dataset_snapshot_sha256": "894c9f52a55b35824353c7047443fb03968fb4ab2d680a436c5ced1f1aa1432d", "model_hash": "e5466c735d57bd3e32d4607a3e372b1862579edfef7864ca514e709a38853e26", "profile_id": "B2", "response": {"answer_text": "**B. 广藿香**\n\n**Rationale:**  \n湿浊中阻之呕吐属于中医辨证中的湿邪困脾证，主要表现为呕吐、胸闷、舌苔厚腻等。广藿香具有化湿醒脾、发表解暑的功效，是治疗湿浊中阻呕吐的常用药物。其他选项如猪苓、石韦、茯苓、海金沙多用于利水渗湿，不适用于湿浊中阻之呕吐。", "citations": [], "input_tokens": 977, "latency_ms": 39444.133, "memory_mode": "off", "model_variant": "qwen3_8b_base", "output_tokens": 835, "parsed_answer": "B", "provider_calls": 3, "reasoning_mode": "adaptive_mdt", "retrieval_mode": "off", "safety_flags": [], "system_profile": "B2", "tool_calls": 0, "trace_id": "harness-fc8a5ab3aede40958af158f6382dcd3e"}, "run_identity": "6b174204f91eba35b1687e6fec05eab311db1cb11982ee2b3fdded385f7bfef8", "score": {"case_id": "cmb:1002", "category": "执业医师", "correct": true, "metric": "exact_choice_accuracy", "parse_success": true}, "source_revision": "935fbc09edf1303d89872b21265ff597f426ac0d", "trace_summary": {"mdt_activated": false, "mdt_complexity": "basic", "retrieval_calls": 0, "retrieved_documents": 0}}
