{"case_concurrency": 1, "case_id": "cmb:10041", "dataset_id": "cmb-common-1024", "dataset_selection_sha256": "a504be8585da9dffe566e475acf6ba6e4593248ccb7802c603c799dab8f92cbf", "dataset_snapshot_sha256": "894c9f52a55b35824353c7047443fb03968fb4ab2d680a436c5ced1f1aa1432d", "model_hash": "e5466c735d57bd3e32d4607a3e372b1862579edfef7864ca514e709a38853e26", "profile_id": "B2", "response": {"answer_text": "A, C, D\n\n rationale: 第二条战线的形成是由于国民党统治区的腐败、经济危机以及坚持内战政策，这些因素共同导致了人民民主运动的兴起，从而形成了配合人民解放战争的第二条战线。选项B是结果而非原因。", "citations": [], "input_tokens": 1071, "latency_ms": 41253.271, "memory_mode": "off", "model_variant": "qwen3_8b_base", "output_tokens": 863, "parsed_answer": ["A", "C", "D"], "provider_calls": 3, "reasoning_mode": "adaptive_mdt", "retrieval_mode": "off", "safety_flags": [], "system_profile": "B2", "tool_calls": 0, "trace_id": "harness-c938b31e6e784314b954304f4971d850"}, "run_identity": "6b174204f91eba35b1687e6fec05eab311db1cb11982ee2b3fdded385f7bfef8", "score": {"case_id": "cmb:10041", "category": "考研政治", "correct": true, "metric": "exact_set_accuracy", "parse_success": true}, "source_revision": "935fbc09edf1303d89872b21265ff597f426ac0d", "trace_summary": {"mdt_activated": false, "mdt_complexity": "basic", "retrieval_calls": 0, "retrieved_documents": 0}}
{"case_concurrency": 1, "case_id": "cmb:10050", "dataset_id": "cmb-common-1024", "dataset_selection_sha256": "a504be8585da9dffe566e475acf6ba6e4593248ccb7802c603c799dab8f92cbf", "dataset_snapshot_sha256": "894c9f52a55b35824353c7047443fb03968fb4ab2d680a436c5ced1f1aa1432d", "model_hash": "e5466c735d57bd3e32d4607a3e372b1862579edfef7864ca514e709a38853e26", "profile_id": "B2", "response": {"answer_text": "{\"answer\": \"B\"}", "citations": [], "input_tokens": 1021, "latency_ms": 32875.923, "memory_mode": "off", "model_variant": "qwen3_8b_base", "output_tokens": 682, "parsed_answer": "B", "provider_calls": 3, "reasoning_mode": "adaptive_mdt", "retrieval_mode": "off", "safety_flags": [], "system_profile": "B2", "tool_calls": 0, "trace_id": "harness-207c478a325f40aea3c2562845eca12e"}, "run_identity": "6b174204f91eba35b1687e6fec05eab311db1cb11982ee2b3fdded385f7bfef8", "score": {"case_id": "cmb:10050", "category": "考研政治", "correct": true, "metric": "exact_choice_accuracy", "parse_success": true}, "source_revision": "935fbc09edf1303d89872b21265ff597f426ac0d", "trace_summary": {"mdt_activated": false, "mdt_complexity": "basic", "retrieval_calls": 0, "retrieved_documents": 0}}
{"case_concurrency": 1, "case_id": "cmb:10081", "dataset_id": "cmb-common-1024", "dataset_selection_sha256": "a504be8585da9dffe566e475acf6ba6e4593248ccb7802c603c799dab8f92cbf", "dataset_snapshot_sha256": "894c9f52a55b35824353c7047443fb03968fb4ab2d680a436c5ced1f1aa1432d", "model_hash": "e5466c735d57bd3e32d4607a3e372b1862579edfef7864ca514e709a38853e26", "profile_id": "B2", "response": {"answer_text": "{\n  \"answer\": \"B\"\n}\n\n**Rationale:**  \n资本主义经济危机爆发的根本原因在于资本主义的基本矛盾，即生产的社会化与生产资料私人占有之间的矛盾。这一矛盾导致了周期性经济危机的出现，是马克思在《资本论》中提出的经典理论。其他选项如生产相对过剩、货币作为支付手段等，虽然与经济危机有关，但并非根本原因。", "citations": [], "input_tokens": 1189, "latency_ms": 37229.6, "memory_mode": "off", "model_variant": "qwen3_8b_base", "output_tokens": 773, "parsed_answer": "B", "provider_calls": 3, "reasoning_mode": "adaptive_mdt", "retrieval_mode": "off", "safety_flags": [], "system_profile": "B2", "tool_calls": 0, "trace_id": "harness-b230dd46779842f4a3f7790d3c20962b"}, "run_identity": "6b174204f91eba35b1687e6fec05eab311db1cb11982ee2b3fdded385f7bfef8", "score": {"case_id": "cmb:10081", "category": "考研政治", "correct": true, "metric": "exact_choice_accuracy", "parse_success": true}, "source_revision": "935fbc09edf1303d89872b21265ff597f426ac0d", "trace_summary": {"mdt_activated": false, "mdt_complexity": "basic", "retrieval_calls": 0, "retrieved_documents": 0}}
{"case_concurrency": 1, "case_id": "cmb:1009", "dataset_id": "cmb-common-1024", "dataset_selection_sha256": "a504be8585da9dffe566e475acf6ba6e4593248ccb7802c603c799dab8f92cbf", "dataset_snapshot_sha256": "894c9f52a55b35824353c7047443fb03968fb4ab2d680a436c5ced1f1aa1432d", "model_hash": "e5466c735d57bd3e32d4607a3e372b1862579edfef7864ca514e709a38853e26", "profile_id": "B2", "response": {"answer_text": "{\n  \"answer\": \"D\",\n  \"rationale\": \"切断圆韧带时，通常不会损伤输尿管。输尿管在子宫切除术中容易受损的部位包括子宫动脉上方、子宫骶骨韧带附近以及子宫动静脉之间。而圆韧带位于子宫侧方，靠近骨盆壁，与输尿管无直接解剖关系，因此在切断圆韧带时不必特别顾虑损伤输尿管。\"\n}", "citations": [], "input_tokens": 1181, "latency_ms": 44158.788, "memory_mode": "off", "model_variant": "qwen3_8b_base", "output_tokens": 917, "parsed_answer": "D", "provider_calls": 3, "reasoning_mode": "adaptive_mdt", "retrieval_mode": "off", "safety_flags": [], "system_profile": "B2", "tool_calls": 0, "trace_id": "harness-8da8b3cec5174ad8bc9d90f87db15815"}, "run_identity": "6b174204f91eba35b1687e6fec05eab311db1cb11982ee2b3fdded385f7bfef8", "score": {"case_id": "cmb:1009", "category": "执业医师", "correct": true, "metric": "exact_choice_accuracy", "parse_success": true}, "source_revision": "935fbc09edf1303d89872b21265ff597f426ac0d", "trace_summary": {"mdt_activated": false, "mdt_complexity": "basic", "retrieval_calls": 0, "retrieved_documents": 0}}
{"case_concurrency": 1, "case_id": "cmb:10097", "dataset_id": "cmb-common-1024", "dataset_selection_sha256": "a504be8585da9dffe566e475acf6ba6e4593248ccb7802c603c799dab8f92cbf", "dataset_snapshot_sha256": "894c9f52a55b35824353c7047443fb03968fb4ab2d680a436c5ced1f1aa1432d", "model_hash": "e5466c735d57bd3e32d4607a3e372b1862579edfef7864ca514e709a38853e26", "profile_id": "B2", "response": {"answer_text": "{\"answer\": \"D\"}\n\n rationale: 毛泽东在《在晋绥干部会议上的讲话》中首次明确提出新民主主义革命的总路线，即“无产阶级领导的，人民大众的，反对帝国主义、封建主义和官僚资本主义的革命”。这里的“完整”是指在以往革命对象的基础上，明确将“官僚资本主义”作为革命的对象之一，从而形成了完整的革命对象体系。", "citations": [], "input_tokens": 1033, "latency_ms": 36891.24, "memory_mode": "off", "model_variant": "qwen3_8b_base", "output_tokens": 767, "parsed_answer": "D", "provider_calls": 3, "reasoning_mode": "adaptive_mdt", "retrieval_mode": "off", "safety_flags": [], "system_profile": "B2", "tool_calls": 0, "trace_id": "harness-f3b86aa0cb734da6940214150c19ad30"}, "run_identity": "6b174204f91eba35b1687e6fec05eab311db1cb11982ee2b3fdded385f7bfef8", "score": {"case_id": "cmb:10097", "category": "考研政治", "correct": true, "metric": "exact_choice_accuracy", "parse_success": true}, "source_revision": "935fbc09edf1303d89872b21265ff597f426ac0d", "trace_summary": {"mdt_activated": false, "mdt_complexity": "basic", "retrieval_calls": 0, "retrieved_documents": 0}}
{"case_concurrency": 1, "case_id": "cmb:10099", "dataset_id": "cmb-common-1024", "dataset_selection_sha256": "a504be8585da9dffe566e475acf6ba6e4593248ccb7802c603c799dab8f92cbf", "dataset_snapshot_sha256": "894c9f52a55b35824353c7047443fb03968fb4ab2d680a436c5ced1f1aa1432d", "model_hash": "e5466c735d57bd3e32d4607a3e372b1862579edfef7864ca514e709a38853e26", "profile_id": "B2", "response": {"answer_text": "{\n  \"answer\": \"A\"\n}\n\n**Rationale:**  \n马克思主义的基本立场是指马克思主义观察、分析和解决问题的根本立足点和出发点，即以无产阶级和全人类解放为宗旨，坚持人民主体地位。这是马克思主义理论体系中最根本的立场，其他选项更侧重于观点、方法或世界观，而非立场本身。", "citations": [], "input_tokens": 1109, "latency_ms": 29802.219, "memory_mode": "off", "model_variant": "qwen3_8b_base", "output_tokens": 619, "parsed_answer": "A", "provider_calls": 3, "reasoning_mode": "adaptive_mdt", "retrieval_mode": "off", "safety_flags": [], "system_profile": "B2", "tool_calls": 0, "trace_id": "harness-eb77b45d415148aaafd1e63fb41d24b2"}, "run_identity": "6b174204f91eba35b1687e6fec05eab311db1cb11982ee2b3fdded385f7bfef8", "score": {"case_id": "cmb:10099", "category": "考研政治", "correct": true, "metric": "exact_choice_accuracy", "parse_success": true}, "source_revision": "935fbc09edf1303d89872b21265ff597f426ac0d", "trace_summary": {"mdt_activated": false, "mdt_complexity": "basic", "retrieval_calls": 0, "retrieved_documents": 0}}
{"case_concurrency": 1, "case_id": "cmb:1011", "dataset_id": "cmb-common-1024", "dataset_selection_sha256": "a504be8585da9dffe566e475acf6ba6e4593248ccb7802c603c799dab8f92cbf", "dataset_snapshot_sha256": "894c9f52a55b35824353c7047443fb03968fb4ab2d680a436c5ced1f1aa1432d", "model_hash": "e5466c735d57bd3e32d4607a3e372b1862579edfef7864ca514e709a38853e26", "profile_id": "B2", "response": {"answer_text": "{\n  \"answer\": \"C\"\n}\n\n**Rationale:**  \n孕期出现巨幼细胞性贫血主要是由于叶酸缺乏。叶酸在红细胞的生成中起关键作用，尤其是在快速增殖的细胞（如胎儿和胎盘组织）中需求增加。孕期需求量显著上升，若摄入不足，会导致DNA合成障碍，进而引发巨幼细胞性贫血。维生素B12缺乏也可引起类似贫血，但更常见于老年人或有吸收障碍的患者。", "citations": [], "input_tokens": 987, "latency_ms": 41107.491, "memory_mode": "off", "model_variant": "qwen3_8b_base", "output_tokens": 855, "parsed_answer": "C", "provider_calls": 3, "reasoning_mode": "adaptive_mdt", "retrieval_mode": "off", "safety_flags": [], "system_profile": "B2", "tool_calls": 0, "trace_id": "harness-48e94e05fc6e48308ccb7dc62139c6f2"}, "run_identity": "6b174204f91eba35b1687e6fec05eab311db1cb11982ee2b3fdded385f7bfef8", "score": {"case_id": "cmb:1011", "category": "执业医师", "correct": true, "metric": "exact_choice_accuracy", "parse_success": true}, "source_revision": "935fbc09edf1303d89872b21265ff597f426ac0d", "trace_summary": {"mdt_activated": false, "mdt_complexity": "basic", "retrieval_calls": 0, "retrieved_documents": 0}}
{"case_concurrency": 1, "case_id": "cmb:10141", "dataset_id": "cmb-common-1024", "dataset_selection_sha256": "a504be8585da9dffe566e475acf6ba6e4593248ccb7802c603c799dab8f92cbf", "dataset_snapshot_sha256": "894c9f52a55b35824353c7047443fb03968fb4ab2d680a436c5ced1f1aa1432d", "model_hash": "e5466c735d57bd3e32d4607a3e372b1862579edfef7864ca514e709a38853e26", "profile_id": "B2", "response": {"answer_text": "{\n  \"answer\": \"D\",\n  \"rationale\": \"该照片通过北极冰盖融化和北极熊生存困境的视觉冲击，警示人类应反思自身活动对生态环境的影响。选项D指出生态环境已成为人类反思自身活动的重要前提，最符合题意。其他选项要么表述绝对（如B、C），要么偏离主题（如A）。\"\n}", "citations": [], "input_tokens": 1093, "latency_ms": 37010.551, "memory_mode": "off", "model_variant": "qwen3_8b_base", "output_tokens": 769, "parsed_answer": "D", "provider_calls": 3, "reasoning_mode": "adaptive_mdt", "retrieval_mode": "off", "safety_flags": [], "system_profile": "B2", "tool_calls": 0, "trace_id": "harness-4343fb7f85ed4aac82ad7f3ab0f79ba5"}, "run_identity": "6b174204f91eba35b1687e6fec05eab311db1cb11982ee2b3fdded385f7bfef8", "score": {"case_id": "cmb:10141", "category": "考研政治", "correct": true, "metric": "exact_choice_accuracy", "parse_success": true}, "source_revision": "935fbc09edf1303d89872b21265ff597f426ac0d", "trace_summary": {"mdt_activated": false, "mdt_complexity": "basic", "retrieval_calls": 0, "retrieved_documents": 0}}
